Why bother? If you can get back out of soko without having more than
one or two follow you, you can leave the rest to go feral.  Ideally
I'd take an orange one and try and get it to grow up so it might end
up dying to something and give you sleep resistance.  YDSM would be
nice, too, but dragging more than one pet around without a magic
whistle is quite a bit of work for potentially no reward.  Fire res is
easy as a valk anyway, as your quest is full of fire ants and -
giants.  I'd just leave the rest behind, as you're not likely to want
to enter soko II-IV for the rest of the game anyway.

If you get a magic whistle really soon, you can come back and grab 2-3
of them to take around with you.  Otherwise I'd forget about them.

