Before you abandon that pet horde see if anyone will stamp on that
topaz ring.  If they like it, put it on and zap enlightenment again -
you might be lucky enough for it to be polycontrol.  You've probably
already thought of this.

> =A0B - a maple wand
What's this one?  If it's not a bones wand, I tend to zap non-engrave-
message wands at myself.  If it still gives no message, it's opening,
locking or nothing.
If it's an 'engraving vanishes' one, drop everything and zap yourself
in a no-teleport level like soko. If it's cancel, the polyring will
become uncursed.  Make sure you do drop everything though - you don't
want to end up with a +0 small shield...

You have that wand of enlightenment, so it's easy to find out when
it's safe to pray.  If you kill hostiles only for a bit and then pray,
you might get rid of the 'minor trouble' of your cursed ring.
You've a much better chance of being successful in this if you're
standing at a co-aligned altar, but the wiki is ambiguous on what
needs to happen for your minor trouble to be fixed by simple non-altar
praying.

